      "code": "\"interpretation\": \"Actual timed events start-assigned to windows; durations clipped at window end. Project labels clipped by interval intersection and inclusive/nested. CPU/APIs are profiled wall intervals, not CPU busy time. Kernel union includes NCCL wait kernels. decode_core is certainly after first committed callback; decode_expanded brackets boundary uncertainty. Graph nodes correlate by actual CUPTI correlation id to cudaGraphLaunch when present; graph ids alone do not establish launch identity. Unmatched graph nodes stay unattributed. CPUlabels exclude gpu_user_annotation. No speed/quality claim.\"}",
